TO: CCE & ASI
FM: TAOBBS

Good morning!

Kindly please be noted the market status asf:

>>  Current market situation and market future prospects and forecast  by sector ,  ID   TH/VN    SIN/MY/MMRGN
ID market almost no change compared to last week. Although ZIM reduce 50TEU space this week, their loading just around 90%. TH/VN almost no change compared to the last week.
Regarding the NCI, this week our loading is not good for each sector. Major reason as reported is caused by the no show and customer order postponed. We keep best to seize more cargoes on next voyage and till now, except CNHKG, the bkg is keep increasing on other points.
Although last week IADA meeting try to promote RR from Nov 25th, but as the latest information, COSCO/EMC extend the current rate level till end of Nov. TSL/H-A/KMTC has small increase on TH/VN. CMA/WHL no further notice, will keep monitor. Regarding IDJKT, except KMTC increase their rate to the market level, others no change.
As the customers' feedback, although some carriers increase their open rate level on TH/VN, finally may not execute and quote special rate to accounts under such market situation.

>>  General market rate ,loading factor by major carrier in week 46/47/48
The overall lifting of ID is 80~90%, TH/VN is around 100%

